  directQuestion: "Where should healthcare digital transformation start?", directAnswer: "Healthcare digital transformation should usually begin with the operational workflow creating the most coordination, duplication or visibility problems—not with a large technology replacement. Map how information moves across registration, scheduling, departments, billing, reporting and existing systems. Then decide whether the right intervention is workflow redesign, integration, automation, software improvement or a purpose-built operational application. Operating contexts differ across countries and organizations, so the map, not a template, should drive the decision.",
